#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""A small, original reimplementation of the observed Tokei CLI behavior.

This implementation is intentionally self contained and uses only Python's
standard library.  It reproduces the public behavior exercised by the bundled
binary: code/comment/blank statistics, common language detection, table/json
output, ignore handling, and informational flags.
